{"matched":51,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0367a01","n":"0367a","t":"一剎那中無四食者即遍三界"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0367b01","n":"0367b","t":"以變壞時色於自根不能資益"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0367c01","n":"0367c","t":"既能資益何故非食答得根本"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0368a01","n":"0368a","t":"由此段食三處為性觸思體者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0368b01","n":"0368b","t":"地殊漏無漏等有轉易故此解"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0368c01","n":"0368c","t":"食故此無性釋餘世親釋述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0369a01","n":"0369a","t":"是食四食不攝故如生住等述"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0369b01","n":"0369b","t":"根故經量部師既無命根以何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0369c01","n":"0369c","t":"為對治諸轉識故此述正義合"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0370a01","n":"0370a","t":"持故應言此位壽煖等法皆應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0370b01","n":"0370b","t":"不離識如第一卷持種受熏如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0370c01","n":"0370c","t":"絕等亦無五識彼此共許非無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0371c01","n":"0371c","t":"一唯計有三法如前觸即三合"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0372a01","n":"0372a","t":"位以觸為本無有本無而末有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0372b01","n":"0372b","t":"心行滅言行即受想故亦不得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0372c01","n":"0372c","t":"彼若復言此位之心非相應法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0373a01","n":"0373a","t":"定位三事無能隨彼二說不成"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0373b01","n":"0373b","t":"此設遮計若是染者應貪等相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0373c01","n":"0373c","t":"善是善心故如餘善心彼計餘"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0374a01","n":"0374a","t":"故眾生垢其阿含等亦有此文"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0374b01","n":"0374b","t":"持彼現行種故後心淨時有情"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0374c01","n":"0374c","t":"非實如前類破無染心後煩惱"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0375b01","n":"0375b","t":"之無去來故應答彼言述曰懸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0376a01","n":"0376a","t":"廣說訖又彼若言初無漏生但"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0376b01","n":"0376b","t":"經部師言餘皆有失我今復言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0376c01","n":"0376c","t":"故今例之彼最初等下第七卷"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0377a01","n":"0377a","t":"但出所依依止根本識等者是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0377b01","n":"0377b","t":"卷有心地云若末那恒思量為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0377c01","n":"0377c","t":"得名但名為意竟有何理述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0378a01","n":"0378a","t":"解初解彼字次解依字後解轉"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0378b01","n":"0378b","t":"六識不依本識之種子故今第"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0379b01","n":"0379b","t":"即總結簡今言唯心心所具三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0379c01","n":"0379c","t":"學每共王等坐時常舉一足恒"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0380a01","n":"0380a","t":"遂復引證對法第三云述曰謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0380c01","n":"0380c","t":"等義於中有三初解五依次七"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0381b01","n":"0381b","t":"此說見分種名為五根現行見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0381c01","n":"0381c","t":"二別非三結非理教相違是總"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0382a01","n":"0382a","t":"瑜伽第三第五十四對法第五"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0382b01","n":"0382b","t":"與此相違自下第七五七不齊"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0382c01","n":"0382c","t":"解一一疎條無雜過色妙符二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0383b01","n":"0383b","t":"於中有二初立理後引證此立"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0383c01","n":"0383c","t":"七同緣不緣皆定依故若與五"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0384a01","n":"0384a","t":"以七恒轉餘皆間斷故即此總"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0384c01","n":"0384c","t":"第六識不別依色根何得以此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0385a01","n":"0385a","t":"有為法杖因託緣而得生住不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0385b01","n":"0385b","t":"雖是假如命根等亦是決定是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0385c01","n":"0385c","t":"依為此量故此中唯一種類託"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0386b01","n":"0386b","t":"說故五識有漏何以得知亦依"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0386c01","n":"0386c","t":"不漏五識但由七故一切時漏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0387b01","n":"0387b","t":"前第二師等問第八既有依謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0387c01","n":"0387c","t":"等諸解雖文不同理切論成妙"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷004b","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":124,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}